WEBVTT

00:01.830 --> 00:04.800
<i>Incredible! That was a terrific shot!</i>

00:04.800 --> 00:08.650
<i>This must be the rumored super shot some of the media were speculating about,</i>

00:08.650 --> 00:09.900
<i>the Tiger Shot!</i>

00:11.310 --> 00:12.570
We were lucky.

00:12.980 --> 00:13.940
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:13.940 --> 00:18.580
<i>I got distracted by Tsubasa's movements, and wound up not hitting it dead on.</i>

00:18.580 --> 00:20.300
The Tiger Shot's power is still scary,

00:20.300 --> 00:22.380
even after having already seen it several times before...

00:22.810 --> 00:24.560
<i>We can do this! We can win!</i>

00:24.560 --> 00:26.340
<i>As long as we get the ball to Hyuga,</i>

00:26.340 --> 00:28.090
<i>we are sure to win this.</i>

00:32.430 --> 00:35.140
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:32.430 --> 00:35.140
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:36.060 --> 00:38.730
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:36.060 --> 00:38.730
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:39.640 --> 00:42.350
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:39.640 --> 00:42.350
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:49.240 --> 00:52.070
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

00:49.240 --> 00:52.070
<i>I kept running, lying to myself</i>

00:52.070 --> 00:58.330
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzuketa</i>

00:52.070 --> 00:58.330
<i>that I could live alone, though the loneliness made me burn</i>

00:58.330 --> 01:04.210
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni</i>

00:58.330 --> 01:04.210
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:04.210 --> 01:10.800
<i>kokoro made uchinomesareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:04.210 --> 01:10.800
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:10.800 --> 01:14.800
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:10.800 --> 01:14.800
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:14.800 --> 01:19.310
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:14.800 --> 01:19.310
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

01:19.310 --> 01:24.900
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

01:19.310 --> 01:24.900
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

01:24.900 --> 01:26.440
<i>baka daro?</i>

01:24.900 --> 01:26.440
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

01:26.440 --> 01:27.650
<i>ai</i>

01:26.440 --> 01:27.650
<i>Love!</i>

01:27.650 --> 01:31.150
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

01:27.650 --> 01:31.150
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

01:31.150 --> 01:41.040
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

01:31.150 --> 01:41.040
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

01:41.040 --> 01:41.870
<i>ai</i>

01:41.040 --> 01:41.870
<i>Love!</i>

01:41.870 --> 01:45.670
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

01:41.870 --> 01:45.670
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

01:45.670 --> 01:49.670
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

01:45.670 --> 01:49.670
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

01:49.670 --> 01:55.930
<i>kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo</i>

01:49.670 --> 01:55.930
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

01:55.930 --> 01:58.760
<i>hanasanai</i>

01:55.930 --> 01:58.760
<i>for a single second!</i>

02:00.500 --> 02:04.850
<i>The final match between Nankatsu and Toho has started with a bang!</i>

02:00.520 --> 02:05.520
<b><b>EPISODE 47:
A FATEFUL SHOWDOWN, ONCE AGAIN</b></b>

02:04.850 --> 02:06.850
<i>The ball is being replaced now.</i>

02:07.670 --> 02:10.840
Power and speed enough to blow a ball up...

02:10.840 --> 02:12.350
So that's the Tiger Shot.

02:12.350 --> 02:15.250
Who would've thought Hyuga had such an amazing shot in store...

02:15.250 --> 02:16.870
What are you talking about, guys?

02:17.240 --> 02:18.930
We have Tsubasa—

02:21.420 --> 02:24.210
No... In this final match, we have to...

02:24.210 --> 02:26.710
We have to do our best!

02:26.710 --> 02:29.460
If our spirits waver, there's no way we'll be able to beat Toho!

02:30.200 --> 02:32.530
Yes, Ishizaki's right!

02:32.530 --> 02:35.340
He really said it. We have to do our best!

02:35.340 --> 02:36.050
Let's go!

02:36.050 --> 02:39.980
We should score the first goal and take some of the burden off of Tsubasa's shoulders!

02:39.980 --> 02:40.850
Yeah!

02:41.400 --> 02:42.680
<i>Guys...</i>

02:43.070 --> 02:44.940
<i>Come at us if you will, Nankatsu.</i>

02:44.940 --> 02:47.430
<i>No matter how closely you mark Hyuga,</i>

02:47.430 --> 02:50.400
<i>I will break through and make sure my passes reach him!</i>

02:53.650 --> 02:55.110
It's on, Tsubasa!

02:56.240 --> 02:59.450
<i>That Tiger Shot lit up Tsubasa's fighting spirit!</i>

02:59.450 --> 03:03.200
<i>Tsubasa vigorously closes in on Toho's side by himself!</i>

03:04.120 --> 03:05.710
<i>Tsubasa!</i>

03:08.750 --> 03:12.580
<i>Here's an attack from the ex-Shutetsu Trio, Izawa, Taki and Kisugi,</i>

03:12.580 --> 03:17.840
<i>who have gotten even stronger during this tournament.</i>

03:18.530 --> 03:20.030
In this final match...

03:20.030 --> 03:22.100
...we can't put the whole burden on Tsubasa.

03:22.100 --> 03:23.980
We have to do this!

03:23.980 --> 03:25.310
Let's get down to it, Toho!

03:25.310 --> 03:30.560
<i>Damn it! As expected, the attacks Tsubasa starts flow too smoothly!</i>

03:30.560 --> 03:32.560
Captain! Please don't come back here!

03:32.560 --> 03:35.320
We will stop this attack ourselves!

03:35.320 --> 03:35.940
Guys!

03:35.940 --> 03:37.600
<i>Nankatsu are attacking!</i>

03:37.600 --> 03:40.570
<i>But, Toho's defense in front of their goal is unyielding!</i>

03:40.570 --> 03:42.080
Like I'd let you shoot!

03:42.660 --> 03:43.660
Izawa!

03:43.660 --> 03:46.160
<i>The ball goes back to Izawa!</i>

03:47.120 --> 03:48.140
He's gonna shoot!

03:48.140 --> 03:49.230
We'll stop him!

03:49.230 --> 03:50.670
Let him shoot!

03:50.670 --> 03:53.670
If it's from that far, it won't make a difference!

03:53.670 --> 03:54.420
What did you—

03:54.420 --> 03:55.420
Wakashimazu!

03:55.420 --> 03:57.760
<i>Damn you! Do you take me for a fool?</i>

03:57.760 --> 03:58.340
Come!

03:58.340 --> 03:59.340
Izawa!

03:59.340 --> 04:01.260
Let me shoot!

04:01.260 --> 04:02.140
<i>Ishizaki!</i>

04:02.140 --> 04:04.430
Wakashimazu!

04:04.430 --> 04:07.710
<i>They made it look like Izawa would shoot, but here's a shot from Ishizaki!</i>

04:07.710 --> 04:10.190
Don't you dare look down on Nankatsu!

04:10.690 --> 04:12.940
<i>Wakashimazu was distracted for a moment, there!</i>

04:13.980 --> 04:21.700
<i>Still, he manages to perfectly catch Ishizaki's shot towards the corner of the goal with a long, sideways leap!</i>

04:21.700 --> 04:23.200
Nice one, Wakashimazu!

04:23.200 --> 04:23.950
Damn it!

04:23.950 --> 04:25.540
That was close, Ishizaki!

04:25.540 --> 04:27.430
exhales so strong that his hair gets up

04:27.430 --> 04:31.520
<i>I really can't let my guard down around the rest of Nankatsu, not just Tsubasa...</i>

04:31.520 --> 04:34.880
<i>Wakashimazu, as long as we have you, I have no worries.</i>

04:34.880 --> 04:36.700
<i>It's my turn now.</i>

04:36.700 --> 04:39.920
<i>I'll open the score with my Tiger Shot!</i>

04:39.920 --> 04:43.790
<i>Against anyone else, that shot would've been a goal.</i>

04:43.790 --> 04:46.810
<i>It's true that Wakashimazu is no ordinary goalkeeper.</i>

04:46.810 --> 04:51.520
<i>While my leg is still fine, I should put us ahead with a Drive Shot...</i>

04:51.520 --> 04:57.390
<i>Hyuga might really be an eternal rival for Tsubasa.</i>

04:57.390 --> 05:00.630
<i>Because, the way I see it, every time he plays against him,</i>

05:00.630 --> 05:03.030
<i>Tsubasa shines the most.</i>

05:03.030 --> 05:04.120
Here!

05:04.120 --> 05:06.690
<i>Toho is passing the ball around in the midfield area.</i>

05:06.690 --> 05:08.620
<i>Of course, they'll try to get the ball to Hyuga,</i>

05:08.620 --> 05:12.790
<i>who has come back to play in this tournament armed with his Tiger Shot.</i>

05:12.790 --> 05:14.790
Mark Hyuga thoroughly!

05:14.790 --> 05:15.670
Got it!

05:15.670 --> 05:19.420
<i>The ball is sent to the first-year playmaker, Sawada!</i>

05:19.420 --> 05:21.840
<i>I must make a pass reach Hyuga, no matter what!</i>

05:22.300 --> 05:25.760
<i>The one who is coming for Sawada is none other than Tsubasa!</i>

05:25.760 --> 05:26.970
Tsubasa!

05:26.970 --> 05:29.730
<i>To prevent Hyuga from using his Tiger Shot,</i>

05:29.730 --> 05:31.570
<i>first, I'll stop Takeshi.</i>

05:31.570 --> 05:34.900
A showdown between two fellow control towers in the midfield!

05:34.900 --> 05:36.480
That's just like in my match!

05:36.480 --> 05:41.070
<i>In football, the one who rules the midfield can swing the match to their advantage.</i>

05:41.070 --> 05:44.360
<i>Tsubasa has made it this far following that principle.</i>

05:44.360 --> 05:45.620
Let's go Takeshi!

05:46.240 --> 05:48.620
Send the ball to me, Takeshi!

05:48.620 --> 05:50.260
Koike!

05:51.370 --> 05:54.960
<i>As a playmaker, Tsubasa is my idol!</i>

05:54.960 --> 05:56.000
Takeshi!

05:56.000 --> 05:57.710
Please,

05:57.710 --> 05:59.670
let me go against him now!

05:59.670 --> 06:02.420
<i>Sawada confronts Tsubasa!</i>

06:02.420 --> 06:03.090
Takeshi!

06:03.090 --> 06:07.180
<i>Izawa slides through and cuts the duel short!</i>

06:07.180 --> 06:08.010
What?!

06:08.010 --> 06:09.510
Nice, Izawa!

06:09.510 --> 06:12.060
<i>Nankatsu's Shutetsu Trio attack!</i>

06:12.060 --> 06:13.430
<i>As he advances, Izawa has</i>

06:13.430 --> 06:14.560
<i>Taki on his right side,</i>

06:14.560 --> 06:16.350
<i>and Kisugi on his left.</i>

06:16.350 --> 06:18.110
<i>To whom will he send a pass?</i>

06:18.110 --> 06:18.890
We won't let him!

06:18.890 --> 06:19.360
Yeah!

06:21.230 --> 06:22.490
Izawa, over here!

06:22.920 --> 06:23.740
Tsubasa!

06:23.740 --> 06:24.810
Okay!

06:24.810 --> 06:26.240
<i>Izawa sends the ball back!</i>

06:26.240 --> 06:27.160
<i>And...</i>

06:27.160 --> 06:29.740
<i>the ball reaches Tsubasa!</i>

06:29.740 --> 06:31.990
<i>I will do this for everyone!</i>

06:31.990 --> 06:33.290
Tsubasa!

06:34.390 --> 06:35.160
Tsubasa!

06:35.580 --> 06:36.620
Go!

06:37.010 --> 06:38.880
Drive Shot!

06:38.880 --> 06:39.980
<i>Here it is!</i>

06:39.980 --> 06:43.340
<i>This time, it's Tsubasa's super shot, the Drive Shot!</i>

06:43.340 --> 06:44.260
<i>Here it comes!</i>

06:44.260 --> 06:45.470
Wakashimazu!

06:50.190 --> 06:52.430
<i>So this is Tsubasa's Drive Shot!</i>

06:52.430 --> 06:54.680
<i>It's the first time I'll see it firsthand.</i>

06:54.680 --> 06:59.440
<i>The goalkeeper Wakashimazu is on the move against the Drive Shot.</i>

07:02.200 --> 07:04.070
<i>But he can't reach!</i>

07:06.040 --> 07:08.490
<i>The ball ruptures upon hitting the goalpost!</i>

07:08.490 --> 07:11.240
<i>This is the same thing we witnessed with the Tiger Shot!</i>

07:11.240 --> 07:14.410
<i>The power behind that Drive Shot is insane!</i>

07:14.410 --> 07:17.170
<i>I can't use my Drive Shot as many times as I want. Yet...</i>

07:17.170 --> 07:18.940
A-awesome...

07:18.940 --> 07:22.500
Tsubasa's Drive Shot is something to behold too.

07:22.500 --> 07:25.840
<i>The speed was on par with our captain's Tiger Shot...</i>

07:25.840 --> 07:27.680
<i>It flies over to the goal, then it falls.</i>

07:27.680 --> 07:30.600
<i>No... it's not just that it's falling.</i>

07:30.600 --> 07:31.850
<i>It's diving.</i>

07:31.850 --> 07:33.850
<i>It's like the ball is aiming to dive down.</i>

07:36.670 --> 07:39.850
<i>Both teams have attacked and defended relentlessly from the start!</i>

07:39.850 --> 07:43.870
<i>And among this battle, the showdown between Hyuga's Tiger Shot and Tsubasa's Drive Shot,</i>

07:43.870 --> 07:47.320
<i>which far surpasses the middle school level, is quite breathtaking!</i>

07:47.320 --> 07:49.700
Well played, Toho.

07:49.700 --> 07:52.200
Nankatsu really are a force to be reckoned with...

07:52.200 --> 07:54.690
<i>Just 5 minutes have passed in the first half.</i>

07:54.690 --> 07:57.710
<i>Both teams seem to be on equal footing so far.</i>

07:57.710 --> 08:00.180
That was a close call, Tsubasa!

08:00.180 --> 08:00.710
Yeah.

08:00.710 --> 08:03.090
Are you all right, Wakashimazu?

08:03.090 --> 08:04.050
Guys...

08:04.050 --> 08:07.400
I may have found a clue to stop the Drive Shot.

08:07.860 --> 08:09.340
Wakashimazu?!

08:09.930 --> 08:11.260
Wakashimazu...

08:12.690 --> 08:13.890
<i>Captain!</i>

08:13.890 --> 08:16.890
<i>Please fire another Tiger Shot for me!</i>

08:16.890 --> 08:20.290
<i>It will help serve as a measure against Tsubasa's Drive Shot in the final.</i>

08:20.290 --> 08:22.170
<i>Please!</i>

08:22.170 --> 08:25.550
<i>There's no spin in my shot, you know.</i>

08:25.550 --> 08:29.070
<i>But I think the speed and the power are somewhat similar.</i>

08:30.530 --> 08:32.070
<i>Please!</i>

08:32.890 --> 08:34.950
<i>All right, I hear you!</i>

08:41.580 --> 08:43.100
<i>Damn it...</i>

08:43.100 --> 08:44.500
<i>So I can't after all...</i>

08:44.500 --> 08:46.300
<i>All right! Once more!</i>

08:46.300 --> 08:48.050
<i>Here I go!</i>

08:53.220 --> 08:56.430
It's all thanks to my special training with the captain...

08:56.560 --> 08:57.890
I will stop him!

08:57.890 --> 09:02.310
I, Ken Wakashimazu, will stop Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot!

09:02.310 --> 09:06.650
So guys, pour your entire spirit into this game, as Toho always do!

09:06.650 --> 09:07.860
Yeah!

09:08.620 --> 09:11.360
<i>Wakashimazu has always been so calm.</i>

09:11.360 --> 09:16.660
<i>While I wasn't playing, you really pulled Toho together.</i>

09:16.660 --> 09:19.790
<i>No, it wasn't only Wakashimazu.</i>

09:19.790 --> 09:21.290
<i>Captain! Don't come back here!</i>

09:21.810 --> 09:24.040
<i>We will stop this attack ourselves!</i>

09:24.040 --> 09:26.090
<i>Let me go against him now!</i>

09:26.710 --> 09:30.030
<i>You guys have all grown up so much...!</i>

09:31.090 --> 09:34.090
<i>The game resumes with a new ball.</i>

09:34.550 --> 09:38.760
<i>Oh! Hyuga leaves Nankatsu's goal and comes back all the way to the midfield.</i>

09:38.760 --> 09:39.560
Hyuga!

09:40.270 --> 09:41.770
<i>It's as the coach says.</i>

09:41.770 --> 09:45.350
<i>I bear a huge responsibility for selfishly leaving my team.</i>

09:45.350 --> 09:47.960
<i>For everyone who worked to win their way here,</i>

09:47.960 --> 09:51.780
<i>I, Kojiro Hyuga, will score the first goal!</i>

09:51.780 --> 09:53.690
Send it to me, Wakashimazu!

09:53.690 --> 09:54.660
Captain!

09:54.660 --> 09:56.160
All right!

09:57.410 --> 09:59.080
<i>The ball is going to Hyuga!</i>

09:59.080 --> 10:02.000
<i>Is he intending to act as the playmaker in the midfield?</i>

10:02.000 --> 10:03.120
Hyuga...?

10:06.130 --> 10:07.430
Mark him!

10:07.430 --> 10:10.130
He can fire a Tiger Shot, even from that far out!

10:11.200 --> 10:13.180
If you mark me here, the front of your goal

10:13.180 --> 10:14.970
will be unprotected, you know.

10:15.840 --> 10:18.120
Fall back, Ishizaki, Nakazato!

10:18.120 --> 10:20.390
We'll hold Hyuga down in the midfield!

10:20.390 --> 10:21.770
O-okay!

10:22.640 --> 10:23.570
Now!

10:23.570 --> 10:26.150
<i>Before they can mark him, Hyuga sends a pass!</i>

10:26.150 --> 10:28.200
<i>But there's no one at the front line...?</i>

10:28.200 --> 10:30.470
<i>Oh! Sawada is there!</i>

10:30.470 --> 10:34.070
<i>The midfielder Sawada is running to the forwards' position!</i>

10:34.070 --> 10:35.110
Hyuga...

10:35.110 --> 10:37.950
<i>Hyuga and Sawada swap their positions.</i>

10:37.950 --> 10:38.850
This looks bad!

10:38.850 --> 10:39.740
Fall back!

10:39.740 --> 10:43.450
<i>Kojiro Hyuga the midfielder, huh...</i>

10:44.120 --> 10:47.880
<i>Thanks to mastering that long shot, the Tiger Shot,</i>

10:47.880 --> 10:53.710
<i>he's being marked even when he's in the midfield, thus allowing other players to go free.</i>

10:53.710 --> 10:55.840
All right! Here I go!

10:56.590 --> 11:00.270
<i>Tsubasa goes to mark Sawada!</i>

11:01.310 --> 11:04.810
<i>Did he see through Toho's plan to change positions?</i>

11:04.810 --> 11:06.760
You're awesome, Tsubasa!

11:06.760 --> 11:08.310
Way to go, Football Kid!

11:08.790 --> 11:09.860
Tsubasa...

11:11.570 --> 11:12.230
Now!

11:12.690 --> 11:18.070
<i>This is a perfectly coordinated play between Sawada and Toho's second forward, Sorimachi!</i>

11:18.070 --> 11:19.820
All right! Go for it, Sorimachi!

11:19.820 --> 11:21.620
<i>Sorimachi shoots!</i>

11:23.740 --> 11:27.000
<i>But Morisaki punches it away with a sideways jump!</i>

11:27.000 --> 11:28.370
Nice, Morisaki!

11:28.980 --> 11:31.540
<i>Toho miss a chance to score by a hair's width!</i>

11:31.540 --> 11:35.680
<i>Izawa and Hyuga chase after the loose ball.</i>

11:35.680 --> 11:36.260
What?!

11:37.430 --> 11:38.180
Captain!

11:38.180 --> 11:39.550
Oh no!

11:39.550 --> 11:40.580
All right!

11:40.580 --> 11:42.350
<i>This ball is Hyuga's!</i>

11:42.350 --> 11:44.220
<i>He advances up the sideline.</i>

11:44.220 --> 11:44.970
Hyuga!

11:44.970 --> 11:45.890
Captain!

11:45.890 --> 11:48.450
<i>Sawada and Sorimachi go up in front of the goal!</i>

11:48.450 --> 11:50.690
<i>Who will he send the ball to?</i>

11:54.190 --> 11:55.230
<i>I can see it!</i>

11:55.230 --> 11:56.430
<i>Eat this!</i>

11:56.430 --> 11:59.740
Tiger Shot!

12:04.690 --> 12:06.230
<i>It's in!</i>

12:06.230 --> 12:08.920
<i>Nankatsu couldn't even move a muscle!</i>

12:08.920 --> 12:09.670
That's it!

12:09.670 --> 12:13.000
<i>Hyuga directly scored a goal with a dead-angle shot!</i>

12:13.000 --> 12:18.900
<i>With today's second Tiger Shot, Toho Academy opens the score!</i>

12:29.520 --> 12:32.570
<i>In the National Middle School Football tournament grand finals,</i>

12:32.570 --> 12:34.540
<i>Toho Academy have opened up the score!</i>

12:34.540 --> 12:37.490
<i>This is also Hyuga's first goal in this tournament!</i>

12:37.490 --> 12:39.620
We did it! The first goal is ours!

12:39.620 --> 12:41.160
He did it! Did it!

12:41.160 --> 12:43.370
Our big bro did it!

12:44.530 --> 12:46.000
<i>Kojiro...</i>

12:46.000 --> 12:47.550
We did it!

12:47.550 --> 12:49.460
You did it, Hyuga!

12:50.080 --> 12:51.630
That's our captain.

12:51.630 --> 12:55.380
He can score, even if there's barely any openings.

12:55.380 --> 12:59.640
A powerful straight shot—that is the essence of Kojiro Hyuga's Tiger Shot.

13:00.270 --> 13:05.100
<i>A tiger's fang that sinks in as fast as a flash of light. The Tiger Shot...</i>

13:06.440 --> 13:09.810
<i>Truly, that's a finisher suitable for Kojiro.</i>

13:10.450 --> 13:12.570
<i>Despite not playing with the team for a bit,</i>

13:13.100 --> 13:15.690
<i>he's easily meshed right in with their teamwork.</i>

13:15.690 --> 13:18.570
Guys, don't let your guard down just because we scored once.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.350
The real match is starting now.

13:20.350 --> 13:21.200
Yeah!

13:21.200 --> 13:27.580
<i>Maybe, despite any of my reasons, this team really needed Kojiro Hyuga after all.</i>

13:28.820 --> 13:30.790
I couldn't even move an inch.

13:30.790 --> 13:34.050
Sorry, this only happened because I let him get open.

13:34.500 --> 13:37.760
That Tiger Shot is really an awesome shot.

13:37.760 --> 13:38.680
Tsubasa...!

13:38.680 --> 13:41.680
We must do everything possible to stop him from using it again.

13:42.250 --> 13:44.340
We won't let Hyuga run free.

13:44.340 --> 13:47.760
Also, as needed, the midfielders should mark him when he's in the midfield,

13:47.760 --> 13:49.660
while the defenders mark him at the back.

13:50.690 --> 13:53.320
Okay, let's gather ourselves and retaliate!

13:53.320 --> 13:54.190
Sure thing!

14:00.140 --> 14:01.950
<i>Here I come, Hyuga.</i>

14:01.950 --> 14:06.250
<i>I will pay you back for the goal you stole with the Tiger Shot, using my own Drive Shot.</i>

14:07.500 --> 14:09.420
<i>The match resumes!</i>

14:09.420 --> 14:11.890
Guys, cheering matters the most when we're behind!

14:11.890 --> 14:13.510
Let's make it loud!

14:13.510 --> 14:15.980
Yeah! Do your best, Nankatsu!

14:15.980 --> 14:19.300
The match starts now! We're counting on you guys!

14:19.300 --> 14:24.430
<i>Hell, the guys from Otomo MS have been cheering for us even all along, despite being from a different school...</i>

14:24.720 --> 14:28.080
<i>Thank you for all you've done so far.</i>

14:28.270 --> 14:30.770
We've gotta show off a little bit, don't you think...?

14:30.770 --> 14:31.520
Tsubasa!

14:31.520 --> 14:32.400
Take it!

14:33.560 --> 14:35.570
All right, go for it Ishizaki!

14:35.570 --> 14:38.070
<i>Ishizaki brings the ball up himself!</i>

14:38.070 --> 14:39.450
Come on now!

14:39.450 --> 14:40.070
Stop him!

14:40.600 --> 14:41.070
Heh!

14:41.070 --> 14:42.260
Take it!

14:42.260 --> 14:43.350
<i>An excellent move!</i>

14:43.350 --> 14:45.580
<i>Ishizaki pulls the defenders before passing!</i>

14:47.520 --> 14:49.870
<i>But Hyuga, who was in the midfield, intercepts it!</i>

14:49.870 --> 14:50.620
Oh, crap!

14:50.620 --> 14:52.120
Here I come, Hyuga!

14:53.280 --> 14:54.490
Okay! Come, Tsubasa!

14:54.490 --> 14:55.380
Bring it on!

14:55.380 --> 15:00.340
<i>Now both captains will be clashing for the ball.</i>

15:00.340 --> 15:01.440
Tsubasa!

15:01.440 --> 15:02.340
Hyuga!

15:02.340 --> 15:04.390
Don't, Tsubasa! Your leg will...

15:05.390 --> 15:09.390
<i>But Tsubasa barely avoids the duel!</i>

15:09.390 --> 15:09.890
What?!

15:10.320 --> 15:13.900
<i>Good. If you care about your leg, that's the correct decision.</i>

15:14.860 --> 15:17.930
You coward! You avoided the duel with our captain.

15:17.930 --> 15:19.020
How spineless!

15:19.020 --> 15:20.990
You dare call yourself Nankatsu's captain?!

15:20.990 --> 15:22.070
What did you say?!

15:22.070 --> 15:25.200
Tsubasa! Come, let's attack!

15:25.200 --> 15:26.950
Right, I know.

15:26.950 --> 15:28.330
Tsubasa!

15:28.330 --> 15:30.450
<i>Call me a coward, if you want.</i>

15:31.460 --> 15:35.130
<i>I can't afford to obsess over the battle in front of me and worsen my injury.</i>

15:36.130 --> 15:39.380
<i>I must only think about winning this match!</i>

15:39.380 --> 15:43.550
<i>Tsubasa's superb dribbling makes you wonder whether he's really injured!</i>

15:44.240 --> 15:47.300
<i>Tsubasa has always had a strong challenger's spirit.</i>

15:47.300 --> 15:54.310
<i>This guy's true strength only manifests once he's fallen behind and cornered.</i>

15:54.350 --> 15:57.560
<i>The real reason he avoided our duel was simply because</i>

15:57.560 --> 15:59.690
<i>he's completely focused on winning this match.</i>

16:00.690 --> 16:03.200
<i>Tsubasa is already in a position to shoot!</i>

16:03.200 --> 16:05.070
Guys, stop Tsubasa!

16:05.070 --> 16:06.950
I won't let you shoot!

16:06.950 --> 16:08.160
Tsubasa, behind you!

16:10.320 --> 16:13.890
<i>Tsubasa promptly manages to dodge Sawada's tackle!</i>

16:13.890 --> 16:15.670
<i>He gets ready to shoot again!</i>

16:15.670 --> 16:17.630
Stop him! Build a wall in front of him!

16:17.630 --> 16:20.210
Don't let him shoot!

16:20.210 --> 16:23.090
Go, my Drive Shot!

16:23.090 --> 16:25.640
Tear the wall apart!

16:28.500 --> 16:32.020
Can he really aim for a goal when he shoots it that high up?!

16:32.020 --> 16:35.530
Of course; the Tiger Shot may be able to pierce the goal with just a glimpse,

16:35.530 --> 16:39.940
but the Drive Shot doesn't even need that to succeed!

16:39.940 --> 16:41.690
Come, Drive Shot!

16:41.690 --> 16:45.770
<i>The keeper Wakashimazu chooses to stay right in front of the goal line</i>

16:45.770 --> 16:48.320
<i>and quickly reacts to the Drive Shot!</i>

16:48.320 --> 16:49.120
What?!

16:49.120 --> 16:51.840
<i>Usually, when a goalkeeper tries to stop a shot,</i>

16:51.840 --> 16:55.070
<i>they move forward to limit the angle of success of the shot.</i>

16:55.070 --> 16:57.040
<i>But, if you move towards the Drive Shot,</i>

16:57.040 --> 16:59.920
<i>it will easily sail over your head and fall in.</i>

17:00.670 --> 17:03.960
<i>To stop the Drive Shot, you stay as close as possible to the goal line,</i>

17:04.460 --> 17:07.260
<i>and quickly react towards the way the ball is coming from,</i>

17:07.260 --> 17:11.760
<i>then time your jump according to its acceleration to catch it!</i>

17:15.140 --> 17:16.820
<i>He stopped it!</i>

17:16.820 --> 17:20.640
<i>Wakashimazu catches the ball with one hand right before the goal line!</i>

17:20.640 --> 17:23.530
<i>The Drive Shot is defeated!</i>

17:23.530 --> 17:24.600
Wakashimazu!

17:24.600 --> 17:25.780
You did it!

17:30.320 --> 17:31.120
<i>Oh!</i>

17:31.200 --> 17:32.870
<i>This is–</i>

17:34.620 --> 17:36.080
What?!

17:36.080 --> 17:43.960
<i>It looked like it had been defeated, but the spin on Tsubasa's Drive Shot wasn't dead yet!</i>

17:43.960 --> 17:45.400
<i>The game is tied!</i>

17:45.400 --> 17:50.470
<i>Nankatsu ties the game in the 10th minute of the first half!</i>

17:50.470 --> 17:53.220
You did it, Tsubasa! We are tied!

17:53.220 --> 17:54.680
Tsubasa!

17:54.680 --> 17:57.730
Your Drive Shot is really invincible!

17:57.730 --> 18:02.730
The Drive Shot, which lets you shoot away without caring whether they try to block it...

18:02.730 --> 18:05.250
And enough power to send the goalkeeper flying.

18:05.250 --> 18:06.740
It's awesome, really.

18:06.740 --> 18:09.600
Even if he falls behind a goal, he quickly catches up.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.990
That's Tsubasa, y'know!

18:11.440 --> 18:15.340
The game is just tied, that's all. Now, let's turn things around!

18:15.340 --> 18:16.120
Yeah!

18:18.790 --> 18:21.020
<i>That's Wakashimazu for you.</i>

18:21.020 --> 18:24.050
<i>Damn, I thought I could stop it this way.</i>

18:24.050 --> 18:25.960
That was really close, Wakashimazu.

18:26.340 --> 18:27.590
Captain!

18:27.590 --> 18:29.710
But, your hypothesis was correct.

18:29.710 --> 18:34.600
You are the first and only one who has been able to react to—and touch—the Drive Shot.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.640
Be confident in yourself and keep going!

18:36.640 --> 18:37.810
Sure!

18:38.730 --> 18:40.640
<i>The Drive Shot...</i>

18:40.640 --> 18:43.400
<i>I will stop it this ti–</i>

18:48.080 --> 18:49.380
<i>Don't tell me....</i>

18:50.950 --> 18:55.240
<i>Wakashimazu is able to react to Tsubasa's Drive Shot.</i>

18:55.240 --> 18:59.350
<i>But, no one has been able to react to my Tiger Shot so far.</i>

18:59.350 --> 19:03.250
<i>If I can get the ball, whenever that is, I will score.</i>

19:03.250 --> 19:06.500
<i>The match is back at square one.</i>

19:07.880 --> 19:09.630
Go, mark Hyuga!

19:11.550 --> 19:12.470
I've got you now!

19:13.340 --> 19:15.620
<i>After tying, Nankatsu steals the ball,</i>

19:15.620 --> 19:18.100
<i>and are using this momentum to attack!</i>

19:18.400 --> 19:19.060
Tsubasa!

19:20.750 --> 19:21.310
Nice!

19:22.190 --> 19:25.280
<i>Tsubasa has already shot two Drive Shots so far,</i>

19:25.280 --> 19:26.610
<i>and he prepares for a third!</i>

19:26.610 --> 19:28.610
Like we'd let you shoot again!

19:29.360 --> 19:32.200
<i>Tsubasa can't shoot as Toho's defenders crowd him!</i>

19:32.200 --> 19:33.700
<i>He changes to a last-second pass!</i>

19:33.700 --> 19:35.200
Taki!

19:35.200 --> 19:36.410
Tsubasa!

19:36.410 --> 19:38.410
<i>The ball goes high in front of the goal!</i>

19:38.410 --> 19:39.160
Good!

19:44.920 --> 19:49.670
<i>Both Tsubasa and Wakashimazu clash in mid-air.</i>

19:52.380 --> 19:53.380
Tsubasa!

19:53.380 --> 19:54.890
Wakashimazu!

19:54.890 --> 19:56.930
Tsubasa!

19:57.930 --> 20:00.770
<i>I need to clear the ball, for Wakashimazu's sake!</i>

20:00.770 --> 20:04.270
<i>I will make the chance Tsubasa's given us count!</i>

20:04.270 --> 20:06.150
<i>Kisugi makes it in time to shoot!</i>

20:08.690 --> 20:11.440
<i>But here is Sawada, protecting the goal with a diving header!</i>

20:11.440 --> 20:13.150
<i>Toho get away from the crisis!</i>

20:13.150 --> 20:14.150
Tsubasa!

20:14.150 --> 20:15.410
Wakashimazu!

20:17.060 --> 20:18.830
Are you all right, Tsubasa?

20:18.830 --> 20:21.080
Tsubasa, that was reckless of you!

20:21.080 --> 20:23.200
It's because you passed that ball.

20:23.200 --> 20:24.210
Wha–

20:24.210 --> 20:26.360
Because you sent that ball...

20:26.360 --> 20:30.460
It was a pass coming from his friend, so he desperately tried to score it.

20:32.260 --> 20:33.880
I am fine.

20:33.880 --> 20:36.090
The match has only begun.

20:36.090 --> 20:37.990
Tsubasa...

20:37.990 --> 20:42.600
<i>He's playing with both his left shoulder and leg injured.</i>

20:42.600 --> 20:45.600
<i>We hope his performance here won't be impacted by that clash.</i>

20:45.600 --> 20:47.600
Are you okay, Wakashimazu?

20:47.600 --> 20:49.240
I just got hit a bit hard.

20:49.240 --> 20:50.650
Nothing serious.

20:53.490 --> 20:55.400
Wakashimazu...

20:55.800 --> 21:01.450
<i>Back in elementary school, he broke his shoulder and leg in a traffic accident.</i>

21:01.830 --> 21:05.830
<i>Because of that, he couldn't join the team until the semifinals</i>

21:05.830 --> 21:08.960
<i>of the National Youth Football Tournament.</i>

21:08.960 --> 21:12.960
<i>I just hope that injury won't show itself right now...</i>

21:12.960 --> 21:16.800
<i>A corner kick chance for Nankatsu!</i>

21:16.800 --> 21:18.550
Counting on you, Taki!

21:18.550 --> 21:19.300
Here we go!

21:20.300 --> 21:21.560
It's time for a comeback!

21:21.560 --> 21:22.560
Leave it to me!

21:24.850 --> 21:27.100
<i>Wakashimazu clears the ball and punches it away!</i>

21:27.100 --> 21:30.810
Wakashimazu could've normally caught this ball with both hands!

21:30.810 --> 21:32.440
Wakashimazu's not his usual self!

21:32.440 --> 21:35.690
<i>The cleared ball drops in front of Tsubasa.</i>

21:36.490 --> 21:39.690
<i>This will be Tsubasa's third Drive Shot today!</i>

21:39.690 --> 21:40.450
What?!

21:47.510 --> 21:50.250
<i>Oh, it won't drop!</i>

21:50.250 --> 21:53.250
<i>The ball sails over the goal, just like that.</i>

21:53.250 --> 21:56.640
<i>Did that happen because of the injuries to his shoulder and leg after all?!</i>

21:56.640 --> 21:57.660
<i>It's failed!</i>

21:57.660 --> 21:59.690
<i>The Drive Shot has failed!</i>

22:01.760 --> 22:03.260
Tsubasa...

22:03.260 --> 22:05.140
I got lucky.

22:05.140 --> 22:09.550
<i>In the 15th minute of the first half, a predicament for Nankatsu, the champions!</i>

22:09.550 --> 22:13.510
<i>Tsubasa's super shot, the Drive Shot, has become...</i>

22:13.510 --> 22:16.450
<i>Has become unusable!</i>

22:17.920 --> 22:20.110
<i>This can't be...</i>

22:38.840 --> 22:44.890
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.840 --> 22:44.890
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.890 --> 22:50.890
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.890 --> 22:50.890
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.890 --> 22:56.940
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.890 --> 22:56.940
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.940 --> 23:01.570
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.940 --> 23:01.570
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.200 --> 23:07.870
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.200 --> 23:07.870
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.290
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.290
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.290 --> 23:21.340
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.340 --> 23:25.800
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.340 --> 23:25.800
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.100 --> 23:33.440
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.100 --> 23:33.440
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.440 --> 23:39.480
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.480 --> 23:45.780
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.480 --> 23:45.780
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.040 --> 23:59.890
COMING UP, EPISODE 48:
THE CHAMPIONS - TOHO!
